  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Silent Hill 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/13083/450x258/silent-hill-2-pc-game-steam-europe-cover.jpg?v=1786446000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/13083-buy-silent-hill-2-pc-game-steam-europe/",
      "user": "Alex",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/24491419-1750421269.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "A terrifying remake (never played the original), it was fun, scary, dread-inducing and an interesting experience. Sadly, the optimization isn't so good, I was struggling to hit a constant 60 fps with an AMD 7 and RTX 4060."
    },
    {
      "game": "LEGO Harry Potter Collection",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/11486/450x258/lego-harry-potter-collection-collection-xbox-one-game-microsoft-store-europe-cover.jpg?v=1786446000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/11486-buy-lego-harry-potter-collection-collection-xbox-one-game-microsoft-store-europe/",
      "user": "Lego_fan_2026",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Great for all Lego fans.\n\nShowing it's age now,.when compared to Skywalker and Batman Legacy but still great games in their own right.\n\nAll movies are there and completed the first one 100%,.sadly there is two bugs in the second one that prevented me from completing the second game, which could.only be corrected.by starting the game again.\n\nI'm hoping these glitches have long since been fixed, but either way, I'm looking forward to playing them.again.\n\n\n\nI've only used Instant_Gaming twice, only just having discovered it. I wouldn't have thought to look for activation keys for games but saw it come up in a generic Google search and decided to give them a try.\n\nI've now bought two keys, one for Lwgo Potter and one for Lego Jurassic World, both keys were available straightaway and worked perfectly, despite being skeptical at first.\n\nNo need to have worried.at all and look forward to future purchases."
    },
    {
      "game": "LEGO Jurassic World",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/7363/450x258/lego-jurassic-world-xbox-one-game-microsoft-store-europe-cover.jpg?v=1786446000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/7363-buy-lego-jurassic-world-xbox-one-game-microsoft-store-europe/",
      "user": "Lego_fan_2026",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "If you like other Lego games, then its no brainer you'll love this one too, though showing its age compared to Skywalker and new Batman (2026) its still a good game.\n\n\n\nCompleted once before 100%, looking forward to it again."
    },
    {
      "game": "Gothic 1 Remake",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/6518/450x258/gothic-1-remake-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1786446000",
